/**
 * AGENT TERMINAL — Quvanti Labs
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * A glass morphic slide-over panel that surfaces live quantitative metrics
 * for a specific agent, computed from real CoinGecko / Yahoo Finance data.
 *
 * Displays:
 *   ─ Live price + data source
 *   ─ Hurst Exponent (H) with regime label
 *   ─ Monte Carlo GBM parameters (μ, σ, percentile outcomes)
 *   ─ Fractional Differentiation weights (d = 0.4)
 *   ─ Value at Risk 95% (dollar + percent)
 *   ─ Treynor Ratio vs benchmark
 *   ─ Volume Profile (POC, VAH, VAL)
